ut oda could have chosen to  leave him dead for chapter 1043 and then  resolve it in chapter 1044 but oda chose  to give us something way bigger on the  last page of chapter 1043 we have  zunisha say it hears the drums of  liberation for the first time in 800  years he is here momo asks who is and  zunisha says joyboy has returned then in  the final panel it shows luffy smiling  steam coming off of him and the upper  part of his head melting the has  returned dialogue is transposed onto  this image of luffy letting us know that  as i've been saying for a long time in  the chapter reviews luffy is in fact the  joy boy of the new era last time i read  the spoilers which mentioned that the  grin was spelled as nica making the  connection to sun god nikka at the same  time but as i read the official  translation on viz just now it just says  grin with no further explanation so goes  to show how much can be lost in  translation from the japanese to the  official english translation even if it  is considered the official one but that  was the end of 1043 which many in the  community called the biggest thing that  ever happened in one piece there's been  talks since of luffy's awakening of gear  5 of what kind of fruit he actually has  of whether joy boy would be taking over  luffy's body and so on and pretty much  all of this seems to be answering the  spoilers for 1044 which is just so much  that i didn't expect to happen in this  one chapter but i'm very thankful it has  now these are spoilers and not the  directly translated pages they usually  come out on friday so take everything  with a grain of salt a lot of people  believe these are legit but there is no  100 certainty with these things so just  keep that in mind i found these  translations via oro japan 1. this  chapter is called liberation warrior  which plays off of what zunisha  mentioned last chapter namely that he  heard the drums of liberation so  liberation warrior is luffy obviously or  as some people believe joy boy's  reincarnation now it was implied last  chapter that luffy might have died and  joy boy might take over his body because  luffy's voice vanished but zunisha  seemed to finally hear joy boy's drums  of liberation after 800 years so luffy  disappears joy boy appears it seems to  suggest that but as you guys know i'd  hate that for luffy to lose his  personality even temporarily would suck  i'd prefer to think that the fruit  awakened and now luffy is fully luffy  but also fully joy boy keeping his same  personality in the spoilers we're told  some of luffy's allies including sanji  kid law hyogoro and marco feel luffy's  presence and that he is still alive so  this seems to answer that question that  this isn't just joy boy but is very much  our luffy as well i like how oda was  pretty tricky at the end of the last  chapter as he tends to be and i'm very  glad to see it turned out like this  because if an osutsuki just took over  luffy and beat the bad guy for him that  would not be very satisfying we are told  there is another conversation with the  five elders or gorosei and their  conversations are always hype we want  them to confirm why they want luffy so  bad since they did mention a fruit  that's had its name changed but they  didn't mention which fruit it was i  thought it was luffy's gomugomonomi from  the beginning and said as much of my  chapter reviews back then but it's nice  to see it finally confirmed here from  the horse's mouth they specifically say  the world government has always tried to  get the gomu gomu no me but they have  not been able to do it in 800 years we  know that they were pretty close when  shanks ended up taking it from them back  then a member says that the devil fruit  seems to run away from them and that he  is not crazy since the zone fruits have  a mind of their own a very interesting  comment first of all because it says  luffy doesn't have a paramecia but in  fact a zone which was one of my favorite  theories specifically the mythical zone  theory and furthermore a lot of people  have been talking about how fruits may  have their own wills recently and how  luffy's may have the will of joy boy in  it and that's how maybe joy boy could  take over and that's pretty much  confirmed to an extent here that having  a will of their own part although  interestingly enough they do specify  zone fruits a distinction that i didn't  hear anybody make since people often  cite how the fire logia made sabo act  more like ace when discussing this idea  oda might have purposely made that a red  herring but we'll see it does make more  sense to me for it to apply more to zone  fruits though especially to human human  fruits because humans are obviously more  associated with a will than elements  like fire or even animals which we  usually associate more with instinct  rather than free will and then the  elders say the gomu gomu nomi is  actually not only a zone type and not  only a human human type but they give us  the exact name the hitohito nomi aka  human human fruit mythological model  nika referencing the sun god again so  luffy does in fact have a mythical zone  based on this which is perfect for a  number of reasons a lot of people like  the resin theory but i was really hoping  against it since if the gomu gomu no me  had to be changed anyways we might as  well make it epic and i'm so glad it was  a mythical zone a sun god zone no less  this obviously means that we can expect  more fire powers like luffy's been  dabbling in and there's even images of  luffy's hair becoming fiery like nika's  silhouette which is perfect the eyebrows  are a little wacky for me but we'll see  how long this look lasts whether it's  like a super saiyan transformation and  luffy will be in base form most of the  time or whether it is a more or less  permanent thing i'd heavily assume that  the former rather than the latter is the  case though because we are used to  seeing luffy's base form and i can't see  them making such a big permanent change  and in the images it does seem like  luffy is laughing wildly which does seem  to be in direct contrast to when he was  very seriously trying to stop kaido asap  so at least some joy boy influence seems  to be coming through there and even  though he didn't have the monkey king  fruit all of this goes really well with  the journey to the west story that  inspired dragonball in one piece heavily  since the main character monkey who  shares luffy's name also ends up  experiencing his own awakening and  becomes a monkey god rather than just a  monkey king so my friends it seems like  luffy has overshot the target of pirate  king and become the pirate god one  that's so rare in fact the rarest since  this god hasn't appeared in 800 years  making him more significant than goldy  roger himself so after this insanity we  are told that we also see a part of  hiyori and orochi we'll have to wait for  the images to fully understand this one  so we'll come back to that when the full  translated pages are out but then now  here's the part that initially made me  doubt the spoilers because it seems too  good to be true and a lot of insane  stuff is happening all in one chapter  we're told luffy has awakened his fruit  and now he feels he is fully which  doesn't make a lot of sense but another  translation i saw from nerdsforlifeblog  on twitter says luffy has awakened his  fruit and now feels he's in his highest  peak and both translations say it's his  gear 5. so we can assume that what's  being said is that luffy feels he's at  his peak of power and that he's reached  his final form if you will since this is  a shonen i would never put a cap on  luffy's growth but at least he feels  he's stronger than he's ever been and  perhaps at his max potential as of now  absolutely crazy stuff including the  fact that we got gear 5 2 which of  course backs the idea that he'll turn  back to his base form after he's done  using it then as if this wasn't enough  for one chapter luffy aka joyboy reborn  fights kaido again luffy grabs kaido  from the roof and takes him upstairs and  then attacks him in a savage way bro  that scene i can totally picture and  it's gonna be insane imagine luffy's  hand expanding grabbing a yonko and  pulling him back up i don't know if it  will happen exactly like that but that  would be amazing and the savage part  really suggests we'll get to see luffy's  new power in action and how it may  differently impact kaido which i'm  really looking forward to then luffy  grabs the ground and transforms it into  rubber to return a bolo breath to kaido  this seemed over the top to me because  we already got awakening and gear 5 and  now we also got what many predicted  would be the rubber fruit awakening  being able to turn surrounding stuff  into rubber it's like oda put every  theory together and showed us in this  one chapter as luffy demolishes a yonko  although to be fair we don't know how  bad kaido will be heard from these  attacks but i assume it has to be  significantly more than before mythical  zone vs mythical zone i love it i also  love the fact that now just as magma was  above fire when akainu punched ace now  luffy's sun god powers should be above  magma when it comes to fights it  obviously depends a lot on how strong  the user is not just the fruit but i  like how luffy's fruit now has a similar  power to these two but it is obviously  superior too and it makes me excited for  luffy getting revenge against akainu we  are told there's no break next week  which is just insane i feel like if all  this was spread across three chapters  we'd still be satisfied we'd still be  hyped and it just happens in one chapter  chapter 1044 it is easily the best most  earth-shattering chapter of one piece  yet wow let me know your thoughts on  this are you as glad that luffy doesn't  have the resin fruit as i am and of  course luffy joy boy has got to be the  mvp for this chapter wow just insane  stuff i really can't put into words how  hyped this truly is if you did enjoy  this one piece video and want to keep  them coming you know what to do channel  the power king within and smash that  like button with no mercy remember  smashing that like button is pirate king  energy and passing is scared orochi  energy so choose wisely if you haven't  make this the video subscribe and hit  that notification bell to turn on all  notifications or you will miss future  one-piece videos and updates and while  you wait for the next video to drop feel  free to check out my big and growing  one-piece playlist that includes videos  on all the yonko warlords supernova  admirals and much more linked to that is  in the description that's it look  forward to the whole official chapter  review later this week and until next  time see ya space cowboys

